怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af6727ef4429d1fd72f7231","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536062184,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:14:22","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67279f4429d1fd72f722b","chatId":"45ba1fb32195479b81df2df420a0afb8","sessionId":null,"userId":99810,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"“说了也是白说”——小时候那种失望攒多了，人就会学着把“想要”咽回去，好像不说就不会再失望一次。这份沉默其实是被教出来的，不是你的错。现在有没有哪个时刻、哪个人面前，你能稍微说出一点“我想要”？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"“说了也是白说”——小时候那种失望攒多了，人就会学着把“想要”咽回去，好像不说就不会再失望一次。这份沉默其实是被教出来的，不是你的错。现在有没有哪个时刻、哪个人面前，你能稍微说出一点“我想要”？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2283,"promptTokens":3338,"completionTokens":139,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:14:17"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":29,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00521986644309805,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67279f4429d1fd72f722a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536057343,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:14:17","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67279f4429d1fd72f722a","chatId":"45ba1fb32195479b81df2df420a0afb8","sessionId":null,"userId":99810,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"……可能吧。我好像确实很少承认自己“想要”。小时候想要什么，说了也是白说，慢慢就不说了。<第14轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime